/T (The 13 participants described varied experiences. Some of reported achievement and confidence with little self-doubt; others described career frustration, difficult management practices, or emotional strain. Across these accounts, six themes illuminate personal action, relational resources, and organisational conditions relevant to professional influence and well-being.)
/E (The 13 participants described varied experiences. Some of reported achievement and confidence with little self-doubt; others described career frustration, difficult management practices, or emotional strain. Across these accounts, six themes illuminate personal action, relational resources, and organisational conditions relevant to professional influence and well-being.)
