/Title (The study used an exploratory qualitative design based on semi-structured reflective interviews and interpretive thematic analysis. It focused on meaning and variation across accounts rather than estimating prevalence or testing hypotheses. Interview questions addressed confidence, self-doubt, challenges, perceived bias, emotional demands, family considerations, and organisational support.)
